Subject: [PATCH] 1454: an introduction plan is its one sentence on the no-plan
 path too
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 53461, 1 of 3 on 0167. Conv rows 50065 and 50067 show the stray line
in the same message as the plan, not as a step: the model's reply was only
„დამელოდე, სანამ დაადასტურებ." It carried no plan, so it took the other
path. The server put its plan sentence after the reply, and 0167's
cut never ran there.

The plan reply's text is now one pure function, planReplyText. For an
introduction plan, every path goes through introPlanOnly:
- the model's own clean plan sentence stays, even under the 120-char
  "carries the plan" length;
- anything before it goes;
- a reply with no plan sentence gives way to the server's sentence.
Other plans behave as before (the tester's 1110: the news leads).

